            <ArticleTitle>Median lip fissures and their management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>299-300</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Median lip fissures are an uncommon condition and usually give rise to pain and episodes of bleeding. We report three cases of median lip fissures which were treated by surgical excision.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
